Lessons learned (somewhat spoily):

Wait until you've identified objects before trying to use them.

Especially potions and scrolls--they can have deadly consequences if
you just use unidentified ones at random.  Learning how to price id is
one useful tool here.

Wand of create monster is about the only bad thing you can get
engraving (though you do use up a charge), so don't engrave with wands
unless you're equipped to deal with that one.

Never rub a magic lamp unless it's blessed, and even then there's a
small chance of a hostile djinni so wait until you're equipped to deal
with that before #rubbing.



